cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pbidriver in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "pbidriver: WebDriver for Power BI Desktop"
abstract: >-
  pbidriver is an open-source command-line tool that lets AI agents see and drive Microsoft Power BI Desktop:
  pixel-exact screenshots of report pages, visuals and views, the data behind visuals, blocking dialogs, slicers,
  tooltips, menus and bookmarks, DAX queries, model metadata and Performance Analyzer timings. It works through Power
  BI Desktop's WebView2 DevTools, Microsoft's Desktop Bridge and the local Analysis Services engine.
type: software
authors:
